What is Employee Engagement and Feedback Software?
Employee Engagement and Feedback Software refers to a class of digital solutions that facilitate continuous listening, sentiment analysis, and action planning for workforce management. These tools replace traditional annual surveys with real time pulse mechanisms, allowing leaders to track morale, recognize achievement and address concerns promptly. Core capabilities typically include survey authoring, automated reminders, sentiment dashboards, predictive analytics, and seamless integration with HRIS, collaboration suites and learning management systems.
